+| RC06 | অনুপস্থিত User update/delete | 3 | code | `08_experiments/E2_labelling/batch2_root_causes_codex.csv:RC06` |
+| RC07 | Absent body unchecked code/persistence-এ পৌঁছায় | 26 | code | `08_experiments/E2_labelling/batch2_root_causes_codex.csv:RC07` |
+| RC08 | Persistent required field-এর boundary validation নেই | 18 | code | `08_experiments/E2_labelling/batch2_root_causes_codex.csv:RC08` |
+| RC09 | Create-এ supplied generated ID থেকে stale-state | 4 | code | `08_experiments/E2_labelling/batch2_root_causes_codex.csv:RC09` |
